==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Electric Darner}}
Electric Darners can be found on [[Hyrule Ridge]] and in the [[Gerudo Desert]]. [[Beedle]] also sells them at [[Riverside Stable]]. They can be used with [[Monster Part]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make an [[Electro Elixir]], which will temporarily provide [[Shock Resistance]] to [[Link]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] accepts Electric Darners as an ingredient for [[Yellow Dye]].

During the [[Side Quest]] "[[Little Sister's Big Request]]", [[Link]] finds out that [[Gleema]] likes [[Dragonfly|Dragonflies]], despite her sister [[Jana]]'s fear of them.<ref name="BotW Gleema"/> When Jana hears this, she asks Link to obtain an Electric Darner and other Dragonflies for Gleema's birthday on her behalf.<ref name="BotW Jana"/> Upon delivery, however, Jana will become disgusted by the Dragonflies and asks Link to give them to Gleema for her.<ref name="BotW Jana 2"/> Gleema will be excited about her Dragonflies and rush to show Jana, which causes her sister to shriek in terror.<ref name="BotW Gleema 2"/> Afterwards, Jana gives him a [[Silver Rupee]] as a reward.<ref name="BotW Jana 3"/>

